### Verify the API Gateway is reachable
GET http://localhost:8080

### Route to user-service through Eureka discovery locator
GET http://localhost:8080/USER-SERVICE/users/1

### Route to shipment-service through Eureka discovery locator
GET http://localhost:8080/SHIPMENT-SERVICE/shipments/1

### Route to delivery-service through Eureka discovery locator
GET http://localhost:8080/DELIVERY-SERVICE/deliveries/1

### Route to tracking-service through Eureka discovery locator
GET http://localhost:8080/TRACKING-SERVICE/tracking/1